		{
			dependencies: ["0582CCC6DC37E011"]
			description: [
				"&eCC: Tweaked&f adds computers, monitors and turtles that you program in Lua. Right-click a computer and type &ehelp&f; &eprograms&f lists what is built in; &eedit startup&f writes a program that runs every time it boots."
				""
				"&eAdvanced Peripherals&f wires them into the rest of Eldermoor: your AE2 network, your colony, the weather, the ores under your feet."
				""
				"No programming? The built-in programs (&eexcavate&f, &etunnel&f, &emonitor&f) are a good start."
